{
  "cells": [
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# Dev Environment Notebook\n\n> Hands-on Build It and Exercises."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## Build It"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 1: System Foundation"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Check your system and install the basics."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "```bash"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# macOS"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "xcode-select --install"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "brew install git curl wget"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# Ubuntu/Debian"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "sudo apt update && sudo apt install -y build-essential git curl wget"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# Windows (use WSL2)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "wsl --install -d Ubuntu-24.04"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 2: Python with uv"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "We use `uv` \u2014 it's 10-100x faster than pip and handles virtual environments automatically."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "```bash"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "curl -LsSf https://astral.sh/uv/install.sh | sh"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "uv python install 3.12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "uv venv"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "source .venv/bin/activate  # or .venv\\Scripts\\activate on Windows"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "uv pip install numpy"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Verify:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "```python"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "import sys"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "print(f\"Python {sys.version}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "import numpy as np"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "print(f\"NumPy {np.__version__}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "a = np.array([1, 2, 3])"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "print(f\"Vector: {a}, dot product with itself: {np.dot(a, a)}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 3: Node.js with pnpm"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "For TypeScript lessons (agents, MCP servers, web apps)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "```bash"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "curl -fsSL https://fnm.vercel.app/install | bash"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "fnm install 22"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "fnm use 22"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "npm install -g pnpm"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "node -e \"console.log('Node', process.version)\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 4: Rust"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "For performance-critical lessons (inference, systems)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "```bash"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "curl --proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 -sSf https://sh.rustup.rs | sh"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "rustc --version"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "cargo --version"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 5: Julia (Optional)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "For math-heavy lessons where Julia shines."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "```bash"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "curl -fsSL https://install.julialang.org | sh"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "julia -e 'println(\"Julia \", VERSION)'"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 6: GPU Setup (If You Have One)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "```bash"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# NVIDIA"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "nvidia-smi"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# Install PyTorch with CUDA"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "uv pip install torch --index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cu124"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "```python"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "import torch"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "print(f\"CUDA available: {torch.cuda.is_available()}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "if torch.cuda.is_available():"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    print(f\"GPU: {torch.cuda.get_device_name(0)}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "No GPU? No problem. Most lessons work on CPU. For training-heavy lessons, use Google Colab or cloud GPUs."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 7: Verify Everything"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Run the verification script:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "```bash"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "python phases/00-setup-and-tooling/01-dev-environment/code/verify.py"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## Exercises"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "1. Run the verification script and fix any failures\n2. Create a Python virtual environment for this course and install PyTorch\n3. Write a \"hello world\" in all four languages and run each one"
      ]
